  "own_original_text": "EXECUTIVE ORDER 11622\nAmending Executive Order 11621 Creating a Board of Inquiry\nBy virtue of the authority vested in me by Section 206 of the Labor- \nManagement Relations Act, 1947 (61 Stat. 155; 29 U.S.C. 176), \nExecutive Order 116211  of October 4, 1971, is amended as follows:\n(1) In the first paragraph, immediately following “International \nLongshoremen’s Association, A FL -C IO ”, insert the International \nAssociation of Machinists and Aerospace Workers, A FL-C IO  and \nDistrict Lodge 94 and Local Lodge 1484 thereof;” and\n(2) In the third paragraph, delete the name “Morris L. Myers”.\nT h e W h ite H ouse ,\nOctober 5, 1971.",
